    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know. i know i should talk to someone. it's just... it's hard to explain it to a person. they'll try to \"fix\" the lights or tell me how to find the switch. but what if there's no switch? what if the house is just meant to be empty? it feels more peaceful thinking about the dark than trying to struggle through the shadows.",
