    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even about wanting to die really. it's just that everything feels so heavy and the fading feels so inevitable. like, if the lights are going out anyway, why keep fighting the dark? why stay in the house when it's just getting colder and emptier? it seems like it would be easier to just let it happen. to just... embrace the quiet before it's all gone.",
